  "data_notes": {
    "methodology": "Two series are kept apart. Official pump prices are used before 2021, when the price was regulated. From December 2021 the chart uses the NBS national average across all states, which runs above Lagos pump prices. The NBS has not published a national average after May 2026, so the chart adds NNPC Lagos pump prices up to September 2026 as a separate line.",
    "verification": "Each point carries its own source. Pre-2021 regulated prices come from the existing dataset and were not all re-verified in September 2026.",
    "manual_update_steps": [
      "Check the NBS PMS Price Watch for the latest monthly average",
      "Check Dangote gantry and NNPC Lagos pump prices in Vanguard, Nairametrics or Legit"
    ]
